{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-5235956","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年宝可梦开始游玩","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一亲自体验发布版《宝可梦GO》，在东京公园捕捉宝可梦，并分享AR模式与安全游玩心得。","date":"2016-07-23","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Pokémon GO プレイ開始！","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Pokémon GO プレイ開始！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/5235956.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160726200839id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/5235956.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[{"name":"Pokémon GO","slug":null}],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","Pokémon GO"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-5235956/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/001-477b97b690.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[331,572],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一亲自体验发布版《宝可梦GO》，在东京公园捕捉宝可梦，并分享AR模式与安全游玩心得。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<br>\n增田我也\n开始体验正式发布版了！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/001-477b97b690.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/001-477b97b690.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"331\" height=\"572\"></a></figure>\n\n恭喜！第一只可达鸭！！\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n推荐果然还是公园！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n所以\n首先\n前往位于广尾的\n有栖川宫纪念公园\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/002-44e0087580.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/002-44e0087580.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"357\" height=\"616\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/003-0927358a55.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/003-0927358a55.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"613\"></a></figure>\n地图可以放大和缩小哦！\n<br>\n<br>\n在众多蝉鸣声中\n我遇见并捕捉了\n好多好多宝可梦！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/004-a895006a2a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/004-a895006a2a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n宝可梦发动攻击时球是打不中的，要注意哦！\n\n也请挑战一下转着投出的旋转球吧！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在有些地方\n请关闭AR模式！\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/005-a67a1d2cc6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/005-a67a1d2cc6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"616\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在这个画面移动地点并打开AR模式后\n\n在喜欢的地方拍照会更方便哦！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/006-7e696115ef.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/006-7e696115ef.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"355\" height=\"617\"></a></figure>\n\n不过……\n代表实力的CP居然只有13……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n多亏了宝可梦补给站\n我第一次知道了这位大人……\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/007-c3fe96c82e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/007-c3fe96c82e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"354\" height=\"614\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n那里竟然有一尊\n非常气派的铜像！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/008-9922d9f43e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/008-9922d9f43e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n有栖川熾仁亲王的铜像（1835-1895）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n这是一个让我至今所见的世界\n变得更加丰富的瞬间！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n遵守规则和礼仪\n注意安全，不要给他人添麻烦\n大家一起开心地玩吧！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n顺便说一下……\n<br>\nAR模式\n还有各种各样的玩法\n请试着拍下各种照片吧！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/009-7fcb1eb998.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/009-7fcb1eb998.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"617\"></a></figure>\n巨大小拉达！\n<br>\n<br>\n下回再见！","markdown_ja":"<br>\nマスダも\nリリース版でプレイ開始しました！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/001-477b97b690.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/001-477b97b690.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"331\" height=\"572\"></a></figure>\n\n祝！初コダック！！\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nオススメはやっぱり公園！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nというわけで\nまずは\n広尾にある\n有栖川宮記念公園へ\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/002-44e0087580.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/002-44e0087580.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"357\" height=\"616\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/003-0927358a55.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/003-0927358a55.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"613\"></a></figure>\nマップはズームイン・ズームアウトできます！\n<br>\n<br>\nたくさんの蝉が鳴く中\nたくさんのポケモンたちに\n出会い捕まえました！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/004-a895006a2a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/004-a895006a2a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\nポケモンの攻撃中はボールが当たらないので注意！\n\nぐるぐる回す回転ボールもチャレンジしてね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n場所によっては\nARモードをオフに！\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/005-a67a1d2cc6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/005-a67a1d2cc6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"616\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこの画面で場所移動してARモードをONにすると\n\n好きな場所で写真が撮りやすいです！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/006-7e696115ef.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/006-7e696115ef.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"355\" height=\"617\"></a></figure>\n\nしかし・・・\n強さであるCPが13て・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nポケストップのお陰で\n初めてその存在を知った\nこのお方・・・\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/007-c3fe96c82e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/007-c3fe96c82e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"354\" height=\"614\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそこには\nとても立派な像が！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/008-9922d9f43e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/008-9922d9f43e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n有栖川熾仁親王の銅像（1835-1895）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいままで見ていた世界が\n少し豊かになった瞬間でした！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\nルールやマナーを守って\n危険の無いよう迷惑をかけないよう\nみんなで楽しみましょう！\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nちなみに・・・\n<br>\nARモードは\nいろいろと遊べますので\n色んな写真を撮ってみてくださいね！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/009-7fcb1eb998.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/5235956/009-7fcb1eb998.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"617\"></a></figure>\n巨大コラッタ！\n<br>\n<br>\nチャオ！"}}